  "r8Notes": {
   "x": 16064,
   "y": 0,
   "w": 420,
   "fill": "yellow",
   "page": "round8",
   "text": "Round 8: concrete review and reports (brief: DESIGN.md › Round 8).\n• Review queue: tabs Waiting for review, Returned, Reviewed (not yet issued), Exceptions; table tools; stage stripe (due waiting, danger returned); your own reports are listed with no stripe and routed to someone else; J/K hint.\n• Report page: steps Review → Issue; the report on the left as a paper preview (stays black on white in dark, like printed labels), comment markers 1/2 link to comments, changes since the last version highlighted; review panel right: exceptions (open/documented, note required), changes, comments, routing, history, then Return for correction (comment required) or Mark reviewed (blocked while an exception is open).\n• Issue step: Before it goes out (photos unavailable until attachments; machine info Include/Omit with \"the project hasn't set a default\"), documented exceptions, the version that will be issued, Issue report → AlertDialog. Issued shows \"As issued\", Download PDF and Start a revision.\n• Strength report: drawn only as provisional (G2 open banner and paper stamp); Not calculated; methods placeholder; Exclude with reason.\n• Project › Concrete: sub-tabs Field reports, Sets, Mixes, Summary, Settings (Kyle 2026-11-11). Mix page with draft changes marked; Change propagation in three groups with Why it stays.\n• 1024 px: review panel becomes a drawer over the report; tables drop columns by container width."
  },
