  "r7Notes": {
   "x": 9600,
   "y": 400,
   "w": 420,
   "fill": "yellow",
   "page": "round7",
   "text": "Round 7, concrete lab. Breaks: Kyle chose variant A, list then Record breaks (2026-11-11). Tick specimens or whole sets; the selection bar offers Record breaks (opens the testing table for just the selection), Reschedule and Hold until. Variant B (entry in the list) was dropped.\n\nSame data on every board: lab day 2026-11-11, projects DEMO-2612/2614/2616, 7 due today in 6 sets, 3 overdue, 5 on ordinary HOLD.\n\nResult fields are only the ones the app has now (test date, height, diameter, max load, excluded); kN/mm and the reading count are marked provisional until G8. Strength is only an unchecked Columns option (P1, provisional).\n\nGates shown as open items: G2 strength reports (overview), G8 units/readings, New field report (offline field entry), set numbering (TMP- sets).\n\nOverview boards highlight Concrete › Overview in the sidebar."
  },
